{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/31870782bb3e6ef7904664989fe077e0.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;A side-scrolling beat-'em-up where you brawl alongside your trusty felines!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Yachiyo, our fearless heroine, and team up with a gang of tough-as-claws cats to beat the nasty humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch &amp; Kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grab enemies to perform actions like headbutting them or tossing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/b05a95c8da3ee913ee7c7b1c649d6f71.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Unleash your feline friends and trigger a powerful special move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your feline allies pounce on a bad guy, it\u2019s your cue to strike with a special move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the Cat Button and let the ultimate attack rip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/86e21478e43c57484f1d198ba3b9488b.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Go for an even flashier super move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special attacks in succession to charge up an ultra-powerful finisher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Story&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where unique beasts like a talking cat, a dog that can do math, and an alpaca skilled in traditional carpentry once lived peacefully among humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they were abducted by nasty humans who sought to keep them as &quot;pets.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Yachiyo, a girl on her way to school\u2014until she hears the desperate cries of the captured beasts. Without hesitation, she sets off to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Yachiyo save the beasts and restore harmony between humans and beasts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2885530?t=1772618045","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2885530?t=1772618045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/2214c2d5e66d396fe6d47e212a0d145aff1eea59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772618045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/2214c2d5e66d396fe6d47e212a0d145aff1eea59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772618045","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4001220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/31870782bb3e6ef7904664989fe077e0.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;A side-scrolling beat-'em-up where you brawl alongside your trusty felines!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Yachiyo, our fearless heroine, and team up with a gang of tough-as-claws cats to beat the nasty humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch &amp; Kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grab enemies to perform actions like headbutting them or tossing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/b05a95c8da3ee913ee7c7b1c649d6f71.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Unleash your feline friends and trigger a powerful special move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your feline allies pounce on a bad guy, it\u2019s your cue to strike with a special move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the Cat Button and let the ultimate attack rip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/86e21478e43c57484f1d198ba3b9488b.avif?t=1772618045\" alt=\"--------------------------------------------\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Go for an even flashier super move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special attacks in succession to charge up an ultra-powerful finisher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Story&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where unique beasts like a talking cat, a dog that can do math, and an alpaca skilled in traditional carpentry once lived peacefully among humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they were abducted by nasty humans who sought to keep them as &quot;pets.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Yachiyo, a girl on her way to school\u2014until she hears the desperate cries of the captured beasts. Without hesitation, she sets off to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Yachiyo save the beasts and restore harmony between humans and beasts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wandering Wonder Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/6f6dc31809ea8cec825ab191c5fa8f15d876d830/header.jpg?t=1772618045","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2885530/880450/6bec42a46632e90808b3f53744807f9089bc79e6/1750950644/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745968356","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2885530/880450/6bec42a46632e90808b3f53744807f9089bc79e6/1750950644/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745968356","highlight":true,"hl